    "ask": "Is 3/8 of a cake the same amount as 3/4 of the same cake?",
    "repair": "Fold a strip in quarters, shade 3, fold again into eighths and let the child count the shaded eighths. Ask: when every piece was cut in two, what happened to the number of shaded pieces?",
    "error": "Changes only the denominator and leaves the numerator unchanged.",
